@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Unified Prompt to Inline Artifact
actor User
participant "Web/PWA" as UI
participant BFF
participant Authorization as Auth
participant "Conversation Service" as Conv
participant "AI Orchestrator" as AI
participant "Artifact/Version Service" as Ver
participant Audit
User -> UI : Enter lecturer-support request
UI -> BFF : prompt + attachments + conversation
BFF -> Auth : authorize tenant/scope/action
Auth --> BFF : allowed context
BFF -> Conv : create user message
Conv -> AI : execute with allowed context
AI --> Conv : validated response + sources
Conv -> Ver : save inline artifact version
Ver --> Conv : version ID
Conv -> Audit : record execution and sources
Conv --> BFF : stream response events
BFF --> UI : render in same conversation
UI --> User : edit/refine/export/version
@enduml
